        "params": {
          "text": "LORENZ_ATTRACTOR\nsigma=10, rho=28, beta=8/3; initial (1,1,1) and (1.000001,1,1).\nRun 40 model seconds at 4000 Hz. Double-click Scope and phase viewers.\nEquations, experiments and numerical limits: examples/lorenz/README.md.\nState at step k represents (k-1)*dt; observation label is k*dt.\nExperimental teaching model; manual Studio workflow remains unqualified.",
